{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：17:21 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>韓劇男神朴寶劍今日身穿厚羽絨現身金鐘出席品牌活動，活動約於下午3時45分舉行，未到2點，活動場地已企滿過千粉絲「霸位」為一睹男神朴寶劍的出現，企滿了三層商場。</p>\n<img alt=\"韓劇男神朴寶劍今日現身金鐘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cfddaefd01948a84fd5b9116f7bce450/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_23.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朴寶劍出席品牌活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cb9f2d5784ea8e758f1ab18ebaa8516f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_24_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男神好親民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1440f22f43b93616ed8c8fd27b64043a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_24_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"fans帶埋應援捧場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/09920f4c71b69d44c8c72d69916fbd69/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_25_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"過千粉絲霸位迫爆三層商場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c61c312b5f026742d46dee5f968fcaa4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_25.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男神大派心心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5fa678ad9e35b7a2d0f6234807f4c4cd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_26.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陣陣歡呼聲歡迎朴寶劍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ec3e7481d99151bde295f5ea2f58f25b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朴寶劍着上品牌厚羽絨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e948fd8e99f8366e1e19b55a33bf7b6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_40.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男神坐埋落地做宣傳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2b0c6ed5994ec7b9008010daa77f26e0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_42_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"真係好合作呀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f8cb5744363df3796250cf7cf54118fa/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朴寶劍用廣東話冧fans。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fa20642abd7e0ee85b22c0ca66675f3f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_44_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"他說：我掛住你哋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/51bfe5cd694870853fd86be0eec47e9a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_45.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"又揮手打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ae8ebd3af51e29d2271f62d8186a89f9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_46_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"好有禮貌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7573062c2873cda116c63a4fa4daa2e7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不停和觀眾互動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b9b73e93163b40e0f52887e7a6546f0b/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_47_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朴寶劍更繞場一周，替粉絲簽名。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c57eff778907e0c6275f619710538a1e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_16_25_48_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>朴寶劍繞場一周簽名</h2>\n<p>其後朴寶劍到場，隨即引來陣陣歡呼聲。拍照環節，朴寶劍更擺出畀心、舉yeah姿勢，十分可愛！朴寶劍更合作到坐埋落地宣傳。閒談環節中，朴寶劍直言能再次到訪香港而感到開心，更以廣東話向粉絲們打招呼，說：「大家好，我好掛你哋，我係朴寶劍。」最後，朴寶劍與全場粉絲大合照，更繞場一周，替粉絲簽名，十分親民！</p>\n<h2>朴寶劍想參加香港馬拉松</h2>\n<p>閒談環節，朴寶劍十分有禮貌，先向司儀打招呼說：「事隔一年再返到嚟香港，好開心見到大家。好多謝大家嚟到呢度，填滿成個空間。」司儀問他會不會參加香港馬拉松？他回答，他表示知道3月有馬拉松，說：「我都好想參加，但係都要有足夠體力同訓練，有機會嘅話，可以試吓。」他也表示，想在香港行山，詢問司儀的建議時，司儀表示金鐘的行山徑便捷又美麗，朴寶劍也回答：「多謝建議，今次行程都唔係好長時間，希望下次可以去你推薦嘅地方。」</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:39:04.523804+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":481,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T09:21:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T12:37:51.271840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:37:51.271840+00:00","content_hash":"2ee47d39602b6108b1392237b9034ce503b3eaeb70131e810373db80a7be7726","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}